{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1759778428\" width=616 height=108 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/aea584bf55d57d14a25db866a00b4ba5.poster.avif?t=1759778428\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/aea584bf55d57d14a25db866a00b4ba5.webm?t=1759778428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/aea584bf55d57d14a25db866a00b4ba5.mp4?t=1759778428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Planet is a Competitive Sci-Fi 2D fighter with a rich and immersive universe, spanning exotic planets, advanced cities, and alien races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECTOR-K </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Planet is developed by 3 longtime competitors.  Our focus is to create a fighting game with a solid foundation of competitive mechanics while also introducing a new depth of story, humor, and design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/80669f2320a6706b7c975039513d75f2.poster.avif?t=1759778428\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/80669f2320a6706b7c975039513d75f2.webm?t=1759778428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/extras/80669f2320a6706b7c975039513d75f2.mp4?t=1759778428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roy, an undercover Detective for the Luna PD is caught up in a galactic conspiracy. Framed for a high profile murder, he must follow his only lead to Planet K-0. Known to many as Punch Planet, it is the central hub for the evil scum of the Universe. There, he will have to track down the real murderer and bring them back to his home world in an attempt to clear his name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Planet features classic 1v1 competitive multiplayer and online gameplay featuring GGPO.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Versus Mode  \t</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Planet features classic 1v1 competitive multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus CPU Mode  \t</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the CPU with multiple difficulty and behavior settings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Versus Mode  \t</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online featuring official GGPO rollback netcode.  Join the official Punch Planet Discord for community matchmaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Training Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch planet features a robust training mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Box Viewers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame Data Overlay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dummy Recording</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversal Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State Saving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch planet will feature a variety of single player modes including Arcade and Trials. Arcade mode includes animated cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Canceling (T-METER)\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Civilization has reached new heights. With the introduction of Time Canceling Devices, users are able to travel through time! The technology is fairly new and limited, currently allowing travel up to 1 second into the past for small corrections to everyday problems. The devices come equipped with an auto fail safe which will disintegrate your former self preventing any possible time paradox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these devices to perform special mechanics such as Double Time Canceling (DTC), Jump Time Canceling (JTC), and Absorb Time Canceling (ATC). Be careful, energy is limited and is directly connected to your TC Meter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Attacks (E-METER)\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform enhanced versions of your characters unique attacks by spending 1 E-Meter. Combine 2 or more E-Meter stocks to execute a powerful Advanced Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AVAILABLE NOW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Playable Characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer (GGPO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local, and CPU Versus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMING SOON</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 New character</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"On The Run!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/d2ba6dc9e28301526e0b85c429250e12984e7277.jpg"},{"name":"Anytime Anywhere!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/35dd1c86bffd7d71e7331a5d6600e091cca1bcfc.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Metal!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/3425c47febcd69ea4a737f05a163131e3f0b903a.jpg"},{"name":"Good Boy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/7ffd3ca0625302e69858ae5c3fc2b83ee2ae6d31.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Target!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/9d71024f518f29daed6670c28ce9e07dd82bd623.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Hour!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/d05e1463e71e3fb113c821fcb76d120f46eeb88f.jpg"},{"name":"Beep Boop!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/6b546e3f2fc9ab6c939ce08d936fbf79a57dcbc0.jpg"},{"name":"I Am Supreme!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/924ac38b523e5caadb922843dfa31bf86ac22e6f.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Arcade Mode with All Characters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/2261617490017f6524e44c42a8eab6b96978bec4.jpg"},{"name":"Freeze Punk!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/577970/5ef407ed987fd9131e3869cb702369a873cd29ee.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/577970?t=1759778428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta