ode  \t</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online featuring official GGPO rollback netcode.  Join the official Punch Planet Discord for community matchmaking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Training Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch planet features a robust training mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Box Viewers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame Data Overlay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dummy Recording</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversal Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State Saving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CPU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch planet will feature a variety of single player modes including Arcade and Trials. Arcade mode includes animated cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Canceling (T-METER)\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Civilization has reached new heights. With the introduction of Time Canceling Devices, users are able to travel through time! The technology is fairly new and limited, currently allowing travel up to 1 second into the past for small corrections to everyday problems. The devices come equipped with an auto fail safe which will disintegrate your former self preventing any possible time paradox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these devices to perform special mechanics such as Double Time Canceling (DTC), Jump Time Canceling (JTC), and Absorb Time Canceling (ATC). Be careful, energy is limited and is directly connected to your TC Meter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Attacks (E-METER)\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform enhanced versions of your characters unique attacks by spending 1 E-Meter. Combine 2 or more E-Meter stocks to execute a powerful Advanced Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AVAILABLE NOW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Playable Characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer (GGPO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local, and CPU Versus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMING SOON</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 New character</p>","developers":["Sector-K Games"],"dlc":[1052860,1059480,1062300,1204820,1206390,1206400,1600540,1600541],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/577970/header.jpg?t=1759778428","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Punch Planet and all its characters are property of Sector-K Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/577970/1764473287/847a04643df131da73e98dbf6b35693b366aeb99/1756823738/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756826567","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/577970/1764473287/847a04643df131da73e98dbf6b35693b366aeb99/1756823738/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756826567","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/577970/1764473287/847a04643df131da73e98dbf6b35693b366aeb99/17568